      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0009:0001",
      "blockId": "blockquote:discussion:0009",
      "type": "blockquote",
      "source": "**Note**: The photo capture system supports both *preview* and *thumbnail* images as companions to the full-size primary image in a photo capture.",
      "normalizedSource": "**Note**: The photo capture system supports both *preview* and *thumbnail* images as companions to the full-size primary image in a photo capture.",
      "sourceHash": "9cfd2d62477262d2d9dd075d85a6fd0f99c88d45a177b90182878ab0c9a2525f",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Aspect ratio is determined by capture format and by device orientation at the moment of capture.",
      "contextAfter": "A preview image is intended for immediate display (as seen when taking photos in the iOS Camera app), and as such is sized for full-screen presentation on the current device.",
      "documentTitle": "previewDimensions",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "ko": "**참고**: 사진 캡처 시스템은 전체 크기의 기본 이미지에 보조 이미지인 *preview* 및 *thumbnail*을 모두 지원합니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
